est underline underline-offset-4\">Olive Young</a> <!-- -->and<!-- --> <a href=\"/retailers/yesstyle\" class=\"text-forest underline underline-offset-4\">YesStyle</a> <!-- -->clear our authenticity gate — pick by fit (shipping, value posture, what each is best for), then confirm the live landed price per product on the<!-- --> <a href=\"/catalog\" class=\"text-forest underline underline-offset-4\">catalog</a>.</p><section class=\"mt-8\" aria-labelledby=\"answer-heading\"><h2 id=\"answer-heading\" class=\"font-display text-xl md:text-2xl text-ink mb-3\">Is <!-- -->Olive Young<!-- --> or <!-- -->YesStyle<!-- --> cheaper — and which is safer?</h2><div class=\"text-ink/80 leading-relaxed text-[16px] space-y-3\"><p>Both <!-- -->Olive Young<!-- --> and <!-- -->YesStyle<!-- --> sell authentic K-beauty — each clears our authenticity gate, so neither is &quot;safer&quot; as a blanket rule. On price, neither is always cheaper: it varies by product and by week, so check the live landed price on the specific item.</p><p>Olive Young<!-- --> tends to suit <!-- -->mainstream korean staples at gold-standard authenticity<!-- --> (<!-- -->strong promotions and free-shipping thresholds; frequent best-value pick<!-- -->);<!-- --> <!-- -->YesStyle<!-- --> tends to suit <!-- -->coupon-stacked value across a huge k-beauty &amp; k-fashion range<!-- --> (<!-- -->frequent coupons + rewards program; promotional pricing<!-- -->).<!-- --> <!-- -->Shipping: <!-- -->Olive Young<!-- --> — <!-- -->international from korea — slower than a us warehouse<!-- --> from <!-- -->Korea<!-- -->;<!-- --> <!-- -->YesStyle<!-- --> — <!-- -->standard shipping typically 1–2+ weeks; sometimes multi-parcel<!-- --> from <!-- -->Asia (Hong Kong)<!-- -->.</p></div></section><section class=\"mt-8\"><h2 class=\"font-display text-xl md:text-2xl text-ink mb-3\">Side by side</h2><div class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl ring-1 ring-line bg-ivory\"><table class=\"w-full text-[14px] text-ink\"><thead class=\"bg-canvas text-left text-ink/60 text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em]\"><tr><th class=\"px-4 py-3 font-medium\"></th><th class=\"px-4 py-3 font-medium\">Olive Young</th><th class=\"px-4 py-3 font-medium\">YesStyle</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-line\"><tr><td class=\"px-4 py-3 align-top font-medium text-ink/70\">Ships from</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 align-top\">Korea</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 align-top\">Asia (Hong Kong)</td></tr><tr><td class=\"px-4 py-3 align-top font-medium text-ink/70\">Shipping speed</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 align-top\">International from Korea — slower than a US warehouse</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 align-top\">Standard shipping typically 1–2+ weeks; sometimes multi-parcel</td></tr><tr><td class=\"px-4 py-3 align-top font-medium text-ink/70\">Authenticity posture</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 align-top\">Official Korean retailer&#x27;s global store — authentic, on our trusted list</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 align-top\">On our trusted authorized-source list — authentic</td></tr><tr><td class=\"px-4 py-3 align-top font-medium text-ink/70\">Price / value posture</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 align-top\">Strong promotions and free-shipping thresholds; frequent best-value pick</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 align-top\">Frequent coupons + rewards program; promotional pricing</td></tr><tr><td class=\"px-4 py-3 align-top font-medium text-ink/70\">Best for</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 align-top\">Mainstream Korean staples at gold-standard authenticity</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 align-top\">Coupon-stacked value across a huge K-beauty &amp; K-fashion range</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class=\"mt-10\"><h2 class=\"font-display text-xl md:text-2xl text-ink mb-3\">How to choose</h2><div class=\"text-ink/80 leading-relaxed text-[16px] space-y-3\"><p><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">Pick <!-- -->Olive Young<!-- --> when</span> <!-- -->mainstream korean staples at gold-standard authenticity<!-- --> matches what you&#x27;re buying — its trade-off is <!-- 