eading-relaxed text-[15px]\">Pick by fit, not by a universal winner. Olive Young is best for: Mainstream Korean staples at gold-standard authenticity. YesStyle is best for: Coupon-stacked value across a huge K-beauty &amp; K-fashion range. Then confirm the live landed price on the product you want — the cheaper option changes by SKU and by week.</dd></div><div class=\"px-5 py-4\"><dt class=\"font-medium text-ink\">Which ships faster, Olive Young or YesStyle?</dt><dd class=\"mt-1.5 text-ink/75 leading-relaxed text-[15px]\">Olive Young ships from Korea — International from Korea — slower than a US warehouse. YesStyle ships from Asia (Hong Kong) — Standard shipping typically 1–2+ weeks; sometimes multi-parcel. Neither is a US warehouse for most orders, so factor shipping into landed cost.</dd></div><div class=\"px-5 py-4\"><dt class=\"font-medium text-ink\">Do you rank by who pays you?</dt><dd class=\"mt-1.5 text-ink/75 leading-relaxed text-[15px]\">No. Ranking is by real landed value across authorized sellers, checked weekly. Affiliate links, when present, are disclosed and never affect ranking.</dd></div></dl></section><p class=\"mt-10 text-[13px] text-ink/60 leading-relaxed\">Read the full trust guides for<!-- --> <a href=\"/retailers/olive-young\" class=\"text-forest underline underline-offset-4\">Olive Young</a> <!-- -->and<!-- --> <a href=\"/retailers/yesstyle\" class=\"text-forest underline underline-offset-4\">YesStyle</a>, or start from<!-- --> <a href=\"/shop/find-it-authentic\" class=\"text-forest underline underline-offset-4\">find it authentic</a>.</p></div></article><footer class=\"mt-14 bg-forest-deep text-cream\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 pt-14 pb-10 border-b border-cream/10 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-start\"><div class=\"max-w-md\"><p class=\"text-[0.62rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gold mb-2\">The Weekly Essence · every Sunday</p><h2 class=\"font-editorial text-3xl text-cream leading-[1.06]\">One honest email a week.